{"articleNo":"78449","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=78449&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★ NOTICE★ International Student Service Center(外國留學生服務中心)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.06","hit":"3893","attachments":[{"name":"한국유학종합시스템(WSKS) 안내2.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=78449&attachNo=71550"},{"name":"리플릿_중문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=78449&attachNo=71770"},{"name":"리플릿_국문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=78449&attachNo=71834"},{"name":"한국유학종합시스템(WSKS) 안내1.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=78449&attachNo=71836"},{"name":"리플릿_영문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=78449&attachNo=72003"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/7791cfd9-8b3e-4736-a16d-041f354c5638.bmp\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/fe9c98ed-3232-4de2-9bb2-cad3cfb3b2b2.bmp\"> </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외국인유학생상담센터(International Student Service Center)는 외국인 학생들에게 한국 유학에 대한 각종 정보를 제공하고, 애로사항을 청취, 상담하여 성공적인 한국 유학생활을 할 수 있도록 도움을 주고 있습니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">또한 외국인유학생의 편의를 위하여 다양한 언어(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6개 국어)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">로 상담을 수행하고 있습니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">가. 상담 내용</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 유학생활 전반에 관한 상담</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 진학, 전공, 학업계획</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 장학금</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 외국인 체류(VISA)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 취업 및 생활, 주거문제 등.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 상시상담</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 영어 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-시간: 월~금 09:00-18:00</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-TEL: 02-3668-1490</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-E-MAIL: studyinkorea@mest.go.kr</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 중국어</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-시간: 월~금 09:00-18:00</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-TEL: 02-3668-1491</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-E-MAIL: counselling@mest.go.kr</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.